OL,3,GNEWSABuilding set to become Islamic
OL,4,Acentre broken into
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreak-ins at a vacant cinema that is
OL,7,Fset to become an Islamic centre are
OL,8,Fbeing investigated by police.
OL,10,FThe former Ritz Cinema in Easthampstead
OL,11,FRoad, Wokingham, has been unoccupied
OL,12,Ffor several years but the Wokingham
OL,13,FIslamic Centre bought it in the summer.
OL,15,FIt was broken into on Monday and
OL,16,FTuesday and graffiti, including a spray
OL,17,Fpainted "leave now", and other
OL,18,Foffensive messages were daubed onto
OL,19,Fwalls there.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
