OL,3,GNEWSABuilding set to become Islamic
OL,4,Acentre broken into
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Islamic centre recently acquired
OL,7,Fthe building after its previous owner,
OL,8,FMontreaux Homes, went into liquidation.
OL,9,FIt had previously secured planning
OL,10,Fpermission to use the site for flats
OL,11,Fbut that has since expired.
